        <p>Exors, of th Lite</p>
        <p>J. H. PARKINSON</p>
        <p>(DENTIST BY SIAM.)</p>
        <p>MANCHESTER, 46, MOSLEY-STREET</p>
        <p>(NAT. T. No. 1660),</p>
        <p>LIVERPOOL, 24, CHURCH-STREET, ST. HELENS, GEORGE-STREET,</p>
